<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 622.57, up 2.50.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.05.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 310 to 257.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 26,208,730 compared with 22,714,955 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
